{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">李文星師傅於節目《在家宴客60道菜》中，為大家親自示範一道得體又惹味的「果皮骨香龍脷球」。龍脷魚的肉質出名細膩嫩滑，而且魚骨偏軟，只要經過適當的高溫油炸處理，連魚骨都能化身為香脆可口的零食，絕對是一道令人驚喜的宴客佳餚。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e9e5e216-93bc-4f36-b1ac-711899001582.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ubNI0NGImb1788773955.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e9e5e216-93bc-4f36-b1ac-711899001582.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">準備食材</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">烹調步驟</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e889a704-5940-4723-ad1e-332c0aa4566e.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026LcbFpk0f3k1788773956.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e889a704-5940-4723-ad1e-332c0aa4566e.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"3d87d5d3-1b2c-46b7-871d-ce95264233ec.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20264geje6qoVY1788773956.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"3d87d5d3-1b2c-46b7-871d-ce95264233ec.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">小貼士</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-17T02:06:38.458238+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}